Searching for lectern rental in Malaga, Spain, usually means a speaker who needs somewhere to stand, put their notes and speak into a microphone: a conference opening, a company announcement, an awards ceremony, a trade show talk. This page explains the lecterns we actually own, which package lets you add one, what goes on top of it and what we source when you need something different.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) owns two methacrylate lecterns and delivers, installs and tests them with a sound system across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. They are one part of our [audiovisual equipment rental service](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/), where you can see the rest of the range.

