## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear owns two methacrylate lecterns, the kind a speaker uses for a formal address. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) lists a premium methacrylate lectern as an optional extra at 50 euros, and both MICE packages include a gooseneck microphone. Any other lectern booking is quoted with the rest of your event, and more than two lecterns means suppliers.

## Key Highlights

---

-   Two methacrylate lecterns in our own inventory.
-   A premium methacrylate lectern is a 50 euro optional extra of the MICE Pack. We publish no price for one on its own, so any other booking is quoted.
-   Both the Basic MICE Pack and the MICE Pack include a gooseneck microphone. The MICE Pack adds a wireless handheld microphone and a technician on site for up to 6 hours.
-   We publish no height or width for the lectern. If the size matters for your speaker, tell us before you book.
-   A truss lectern is not in our own inventory. We look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one.

-   **Who sets it up and tests it?** Our crew delivers, installs and tests it with the sound system. We work delivery only, with no self pickup.
-   **Who operates the sound during the speech?** A technician, if your package includes one or you add one. The speaker runs their own slides.
-   **What is not covered?** A truss lectern, a lectern with a built in screen and any lectern beyond our two are not in our own inventory.

## Our Two Methacrylate Lecterns

Our lecterns are two methacrylate units, the clear acrylic style that stays out of the way on a stage and does not compete with the screen behind the speaker. A lectern is a stand a speaker stands behind, so the hands stay free for the notes and the microphone is at mouth height.

![A clear methacrylate lectern with a gooseneck microphone on a small stage at an evening outdoor event, with the sound desk and a laptop in the foreground.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/1264/methacrylate_lectern_technical_support.webp "A methacrylate lectern with a gooseneck microphone on a small stage at an evening outdoor event, seen from the sound desk.")

We do not publish a technical sheet for them. No height, width, weight or material thickness, and no claim of a built in light, a document shelf or an inclined tray. If one of those matters for your event, tell us and we say plainly what we can and cannot offer.

